{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Alchemy Duel&quot; is a card game that combines elements of alchemy and roguelike gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alchemize Monster Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine material cards in your hand to alchemize powerful monster cards.<br>Each monster card comes with a unique effect, and by combining their abilities, you can create powerful synergies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obtain Relic Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you can visit a shop to purchase relic cards of your choice.<br>Relic cards enhance combos between your cards and provide various advantages during gameplay.<br>Choose relics that suit your strategy and prepare for the next challenge!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592570?t=1757744677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592570?t=1757744677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592570/d51741b366907e329eead8c8d960d75003aae60e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757744677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592570/d51741b366907e329eead8c8d960d75003aae60e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757744677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Alchemy Duel&quot; is a card game that combines elements of alchemy and roguelike gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alchemize Monster Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine material cards in your hand to alchemize powerful monster cards.<br>Each monster card comes with a unique effect, and by combining their abilities, you can create powerful synergies to gain the upper h